        ],
        "description": "Searches Wattpad's story catalog by text or browses it by ranking, category and language, and returns one page of stories: id, title, description, cover, link, author, votes, reads, comments, chapter count, completed and mature flags, language, category ids, tags and dates. Give at least one of query, filter, category or language. filter is hot, new or featured; category is an id from wattpad-categories; language is an id from wattpad-languages. limit is 1 to 100 (default 20) and offset pages the results: a text search reaches offset 9999, while browsing without a query is capped at 1500 results. Browse pages can hold fewer stories than limit (or none) because Wattpad filters after paging, so advance with next_offset rather than the item count.",
